      "settings": {
        "checksum": "4229f58dee091d0d76c408df267290162fada42489490bacde058568331a41eb_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-QTo1uJ9l_continueSelling": "Restock soon! PREORDER NOW",
        "gg-QTo1uJ9l_outOfStockMessage": "OUT OF STOCK",
        "gg-QTo1uJ9l_template": "In Stock!",
        "gg-QTo1uJ9l_unlimitedQuantityMessage": "In Stock!",
        "gg5Sj0txQqL_text": "<p>NOVALIGHT™ Regenmask is a wearable LED therapy mask designed for at-home skin treatments. It uses a combination of red, blue, and amber light wavelengths to target multiple skin concerns.</p>",
        "gg9Y6HH0j02_text": "<p>Secure online payment</p>",
        "ggBRoVo58cy_text": "<p>Peer-reviewed research published by the National Institutes of Health confirms that low-level LED light therapy (photobiomodulation) has been shown to promote skin repair, improve texture, and help reduce acne.</p>",
        "ggEb3w8J-nI_text": "<p>Please note the change in our refund policy regarding skin care products. For hygiene reasons, all products intended for skin care are neither refundable nor exchangeable, as specified in our general terms and conditions of sale.</p>",
        "ggEks8-3r3j_childItem_0": "<p>Product Details</p>",
        "ggEks8-3r3j_childItem_1": "<p>Return and Refund Policy</p>",
        "ggExFQ0IQBu_text": "<p>30 Days Return</p>",
        "ggLvTyIYcbN_text": "Quantity",
        "ggPYB-oHzpS_text": "<p>Free Global Shipping Above $50</p>",
        "ggZ6_erxvzN_text": "<p>Equipped with a built-in timer and touch controls, Regenmask allows users to customize session duration based on skin needs. The lightweight design makes it suitable for frequent use without discomfort. It requires no gels or wires during treatment. This mask is ideal for users seeking a basic, consistent light therapy routine.</p>",
        "ggatvf3OoBt_text": "<p>1 Year Warranty</p>",
        "ggbUO5STk22_text": "<p>4.7/5 (Based on 629 reviews) | <span style=\"color:#B32308;\">7000+ Masks Already Sold</span></p>",
        "ggiOqyjzx_p_label": "Add to cart",
        "ggiOqyjzx_p_outOfStockLabel": "Out of stock",
        "ggiOqyjzx_p_unavailableLabel": "Unavailable",
        "ggiOqyjzx_p_variantSelectionRequiredMessage": "Please select a variant to add product to cart",
        "ggkCsU8innO_text": "<p>Secure Checkout With:</p>",
        "ggrea1VTNx1_label": "Buy Now",
        "ggrea1VTNx1_outOfStockLabel": "Out of stock",
        "ggrea1VTNx1_unavailableLabel": "Unavailable",
        "ggrea1VTNx1_variantSelectionRequiredMessage": "Please select a variant to add product to cart",
        "ggzPwj8Kr63_text": "<p>NOVALIGHT™ Regenmask is a wearable LED therapy mask designed for at-home skin treatments. It uses a combination of red, blue, and amber light wavelengths to target multiple skin concerns. Red light supports skin texture, blue light targets acne-causing bacteria, and amber light helps reduce dullness. The mask covers the full face and fits securely with an adjustable strap.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-593245303956767535"
    },
    "gp_section_593245303956833071": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "305ddeb1f607a34e0a85d10b9aeee97cc4d79fb220f39e14a2873a92970573e3_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-Rb-aD-vS_text": "Advanced Features",
        "gg3UHkiDQPs_text": "<p>Adjustable intensity levels, wireless remote &amp; pre-set daily/weekly programs</p>",
        "gg4R0WZX4A7_text": "7 Targeted Wavelengths",
        "ggDANyyxxvN_text": "<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>Multi-Function Treatment</strong></span>",
        "ggHR1goxMpA_text": "Key Benefits",
        "ggHZc51QYeJ_text": "<p>Soothes inflammation, reduces acne, addresses discoloration &amp; supports overall skin clarity</p>",
        "ggOnaPUVF7x_text": "<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>Enhanced Coverage</strong></span>",
        "ggQA1Qpwghf_text": "<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>Ergonomic Design</strong></span>",
        "ggWWA9yvBO0_text": "<p>Professional-grade LED light therapy for targeted skin transformation. Advanced 7-wavelength technology delivers clinical results at home with customizable settings and expanded coverage.</p>",
        "gg_CHyPUDv7_text": "<p>Red, blue, green, yellow, purple, cyan &amp; white light – each targeting specific skin concerns</p>",
        "ggcwNqMaNAL_text": "<p>Full skin contact and even light distribution for maximum effectiveness</p>",
        "ggmjvNG9XHY_text": "<p>Includes separate neck panel for comprehensive face + neck treatment</p>",
        "ggtt8z12qMD_text": "Clinically Backed",
        "ggv9DplKddd_text": "<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>Smart Controls</strong></span>",
        "ggvgarHVAG4_text": "<p>American Academy of Dermatology recognizes LED therapy as safe and effective for acne and anti-aging</p>",
        "ggzgQIwkd0a_text": "<p>Built for users seeking professional control, broader wavelength options &amp; expanded</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-593245303956833071"
    },
    "gp_section_593245303956898607": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "b2d92e8b6ca8825def75834e1aa604abd2642611eadc09be37d51911038fdcf6_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg0syJfgF7-_text": "<p>It’s like going to a clinic, minus the on-going costs, the time commitment, the overpromises, the upselling and the hassle.</p>",
        "gg8m4nleWW5_text": "Why Choose the Regenmask",
        "ggBGHIX88MW_text": "<p>Place the Novalight Regenmask on your face, adjusting the straps for a comfortable fit, hold the Power switch and set the time, color mode, brightness and intensity</p>",
        "ggPYN-mD_p2_text": "<p>Wash and dry your face thoroughly, removing all makeup and dirt.</p>",
        "ggSFpFh9gv8_text": "Quick start: easy guide to glowy skin",
        "ggWq6E0YfgN_text": "<p>Connect the USB cable and power cable to the remote control and to the mask.</p>",
        "gggd6dkmyGi_text": "<p>Enjoy your treatment session! Each session should last 10-20 minutes.We recommended to use the mask 2-3 times per week for optimal results.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-593245303956898607"
    },
    "gp_section_593245303956964143": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "d1b1a1a08ee911f10cff546eac8abeb34cb8eecc78ff29cb6612b8eab31bd558_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gP66e8Cuqr7_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">The suggested usage time is 10 to 20 minutes. It is most appropriate to start with a 10-minute treatment, 4 times a week to begin, unless otherwise directed by a doctor. Once you have achieved your initial goals, it is more than likely you will only need to use the device twice a week. Since the LEDs provide a pure and powerful output, these few treatments will be sufficient.</span></p>",
        "gUNlCkSROcv_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">Yes, you can. In fact, the results of your light therapy will be more dramatic if you use high-quality skincare products. Additionally, you can use your acne-fighting products to speed up the healing process for your skin.</span></p>",
        "gaRjC3FbZm9_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">No, it does not cause any pain. It even provides a feeling of relaxation.</span></p>",
        "gg45vFKB4PE_text": "<p>Boosts collagen, reduces fine lines, and rejuvenates tired skin.</p>",
        "gg6RarY8prr_text": "<p>In just 15 to 30 minutes a day, you can embrace a whole new you!</p>",
        "gg6lInRjUzU_text": "<p>| Based on 629 reviews</p>",
        "ggCa8xLwpcg_text": "<p>Highly recommend!</p>",
        "ggDaOA15eaj_text": "Turn On the Light. Turn Up the Glow.",
        "ggDwj8_wWBf_text": "<p>Experience the magic of red, blue, and amber light for smooth, radiant skin.</p>",
        "ggECNERHHTz_text": "<p>—Terri P.</p>",
        "ggFag0SyHPv_text": "<p>LED light therapy has been thoroughly tested, evaluated, and validated by hundreds of universities, medical labs, and most notably by NASA. In fact, over 2000 reports and documents have been written on this technology.</p>",
        "ggH9Kx3_hqa_text": "<p>—Aimee.</p>",
        "ggHMolIHj_9_text": "<p>I have been battling dark spots for years, trying everything under the sun. When I came across this LED mask, I was hesitant but decided to give it a try. After 6 months of consistent use, the improvement is remarkable! My dark spots have significantly faded. This LED mask is truly worth every penny.</p>",
        "ggJhtmpniEa_text": "<p>Targets acne, calms breakouts, clears skin, helps unclog pores, and calms irritated skin.</p>",
        "ggM19vTj5OP_text": "<p>—BJ Nardi.</p>",
        "ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_0": "<p>Is there scientific evidence for LED light therapy ?</p>",
        "ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_1": "<p>Is LED light therapy painful?</p>",
        "ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_2": "<p>Can I use skincare products at the same time as my Novalight mask ?</p>",
        "ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_3": "<p>How often should the device be used ?</p>",
        "ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_4": "<p>Do I need eye protection ?</p>",
        "ggPM_OD1hHi_text": "<p>We use the most clinically effective LEDs available !</p>",
        "ggPpGsL7sXx_text": "<p>Blue Light Therapy</p>",
        "ggQeV9e1HJ-_text": "<p>The Regenmask™ utilizes recognized and NASA-used therapeutic LED technology. It offers you a safe and cost-effective solution to all your anti-aging and acne woes. It is simple, convenient, and totally safe.</p>",
        "ggRVijsNkRA_text": "Why Customers Love Novalight™ - Regenmask",
        "ggRnLH1KW6M_text": "Protect your most visible appearance",
        "ggao1xB6Ysb_text": "<p>I have only been using it for a month. Prior to using this my skin was flaky &amp; dry. My skin barrier has been severely damaged for the past 2 years where almost anything I use burns, but in 1 month this mask has lightened my hyperpigmentation considerably as well as helped to give a bit</p>",
        "ggc3SIo-z5Q_text": "<p>It's our calling card to the world. Years of exposure to the sun and environmental toxins lead to wrinkles, pigmentation, redness, and acne - all visible signs of aging and skin damage.</p>",
        "gghTxE1JEgq_text": "<p>Our face is our most recognizable feature, to ourselves and to others.</p>",
        "ggi6AXMoNKd_text": "<p>Completely CURED my acne</p>",
        "ggjeEPUzAHz_text": "Frequently Asked Questions",
        "ggkKtAcij7J_text": "<p>Red Light Therapy</p>",
        "ggleKWxHNC9_text": "<p>Amber Light Therapy</p>",
        "ggvPpJD-N1F_text": "<p>Soothes redness, evens tone, and supports healing. Perfect for dull, stressed-out skin that needs a peaceful reset</p>",
        "ggxEkl6glGT_text": "<p>After years of searching for an effective wrinkle treatment, I finally found a game-changer with this LED mask therapy. Six months in, the results are astonishing! I’ve used countless serums and devices with no success until now. This LED mask is definitely worth the investment.</p>",
        "ggytYBYrnCN_text": "<p>IT REALLY WORKS!!</p>",
        "guxmczcTxO-_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">The design of this mask does not cover the eye area, so there is no need to wear eye protection during treatments. However, it is advisable to avoid looking directly at the LED and to close your eyes during the treatment.</span></p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-593245303956964143"
    },
